# ---- large media: kept out of git history on purpose ----
# A 40 MB video in git is permanent — every clone downloads it forever, and
# removing it later needs a history rewrite. Host it on Drive/YouTube and link
# it from the README instead. To version it anyway, delete the line below.
reports/_frames/
